(6478953, 963499, 124815, '<td valign="top">Makes me feel very unsteady but I love the tonality and the softness that the umbrella brings to all the concrete. Personally I would have trimmed most of the top, to the point of having the image square. But I forgot that there is no cropping.</td>', 'Makes me feel very unsteady but I love the tonality and the softness that the umbrella brings to all the concrete. Personally I would have trimmed most of the top, to the point of having the image square. But I forgot that there is no cropping.', '2011-07-22 17:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
