(6479201, 963268, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like this for the pattern of the linear seats and the the steps between the seats.  A tighter composition/framing (I realize this is minimal editing rules, so no crop) eliminating the top overhang and the red steps on the left would have made this stronger (at least for me...).  But you know, the longer I look at this, the more I like it.  It is full of patterns.</td>', 'I like this for the pattern of the linear seats and the the steps between the seats.  A tighter composition/framing (I realize this is minimal editing rules, so no crop) eliminating the top overhang and the red steps on the left would have made this stronger (at least for me...).  But you know, the longer I look at this, the more I like it.  It is full of patterns.', '2011-07-23 03:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6479205, 963457, 103032, '<td valign="top">Even with the title, I had to look a long time to figure this out.  Soap in the holes???  This really plays with the viewer''s eyes... bizarre...</td>', 'Even with the title, I had to look a long time to figure this out.  Soap in the holes???  This really plays with the viewer''s eyes... bizarre...', '2011-07-23 03:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
