(6481134, 962896, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is a very good subject for pattern. I think the shot is just too literal. It is docmentary. Try different perspectives and angles to really accentuate the architectural pattern to the viewer.</td>', 'This is a very good subject for pattern. I think the shot is just too literal. It is docmentary. Try different perspectives and angles to really accentuate the architectural pattern to the viewer.', '2011-07-25 22:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6481170, 963229, 64446, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and color saturation, with extraordinary levels of details. An exquisite and engaging image at the first sight, and even more when observing its details and forms... The little bug is just the "cherry on the cake". My top pick here.</td>', 'Great lighting and color saturation, with extraordinary levels of details. An exquisite and engaging image at the first sight, and even more when observing its details and forms... The little bug is just the "cherry on the cake". My top pick here.', '2011-07-25 23:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6481181, 963297, 64446, '<td valign="top">Such a neat and simple image, yet sophisticated. The sharp focus along the "horizontal" line helps the viewer to gaze along all image. Nice that some threads aren''t visible, and the structures seem to be floating... Very well done!</td>', 'Such a neat and simple image, yet sophisticated. The sharp focus along the "horizontal" line helps the viewer to gaze along all image. Nice that some threads aren''t visible, and the structures seem to be floating... Very well done!', '2011-07-25 23:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
