(6481191, 963460, 64446, '<td valign="top">At the first glance this image didn''t attract me at all. On a third visit it called my attention... and it is interesting to notice not only the lighting but the hue variation. I think it would make it mor attractive it the envelopes were spread evenly to see how the color gradient would work - or maybe not...</td>', 'At the first glance this image didn''t attract me at all. On a third visit it called my attention... and it is interesting to notice not only the lighting but the hue variation. I think it would make it mor attractive it the envelopes were spread evenly to see how the color gradient would work - or maybe not...', '2011-07-26 00:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
