(6481622, 963466, 115307, '<td valign="top">I think this image has a dynamic composition, with a nice pattern, that is just way too gray. Black and white images do well when they have a good range, from pure whites to pure blacks. This image seems to be centralized around mid-gray. Upping the contrast here would have made a world of a difference to this image. Hope this helps.<br/> <br/>WHOOPS, I just realized that this is minimal editing. I take everything back and am bumping up the score. Sorry about that.</td>', 'I think this image has a dynamic composition, with a nice pattern, that is just way too gray. Black and white images do well when they have a good range, from pure whites to pure blacks. This image seems to be centralized around mid-gray. Upping the contrast here would have made a world of a difference to this image. Hope this helps. WHOOPS, I just realized that this is minimal editing. I take everything back and am bumping up the score. Sorry about that.', '2011-07-26 18:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6481875, 963492, 64446, '<td valign="top">Good perspective and smart alusiveness to her power. I think she didn''t need the checkered blouse and would be nice to avoid the shade in her lower body.</td>', 'Good perspective and smart alusiveness to her power. I think she didn''t need the checkered blouse and would be nice to avoid the shade in her lower body.', '2011-07-26 23:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6481877, 963267, 64446, '<td valign="top">Certainly you identified patterns which we normally don''t notice and disregard. And you just found a jewel in one of the most common things in life - water! I like that approach!!</td>', 'Certainly you identified patterns which we normally don''t notice and disregard. And you just found a jewel in one of the most common things in life - water! I like that approach!!', '2011-07-27 00:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
