(6481888, 962858, 64446, '<td valign="top">I think anyone would dismiss this image, at first - well, I did.<br/>Only taking the time to observe the trees I could appreciated the lovely pattern the bare branches form (wow, are you in the south hemisphere to get these leafless trees at this time of the year?).<br/>Maybe cropping an inch in the bottom and some of the top, would focus more the viewer to the trees and get him/her hooked right away...</td>', 'I think anyone would dismiss this image, at first - well, I did.Only taking the time to observe the trees I could appreciated the lovely pattern the bare branches form (wow, are you in the south hemisphere to get these leafless trees at this time of the year?).Maybe cropping an inch in the bottom and some of the top, would focus more the viewer to the trees and get him/her hooked right away...', '2011-07-27 00:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6481890, 962896, 64446, '<td valign="top">Interesting structure and patterns, with nice reflections nuances. I feel uneasy the way it`s framed though (and I can`t really explain why). Maybe it is too empty space at the top and cutting its ends at the bottom. I wonder how it would look like filling the frame with it...</td>', 'Interesting structure and patterns, with nice reflections nuances. I feel uneasy the way it`s framed though (and I can`t really explain why). Maybe it is too empty space at the top and cutting its ends at the bottom. I wonder how it would look like filling the frame with it...', '2011-07-27 00:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
