(6482690, 963284, 64446, '<td valign="top">Like the shallow dof and you got a good color saturation. I can see a grain on the feather and I''m not sure if the glass pebble helps or distracts here.</td>', 'Like the shallow dof and you got a good color saturation. I can see a grain on the feather and I''m not sure if the glass pebble helps or distracts here.', '2011-07-27 20:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6482692, 963480, 64446, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract macro - if not for the title, I wouldn`t guess what it is. Great sharp focus and the pastels color palette you pulled off in here!</td>', 'Nice abstract macro - if not for the title, I wouldn`t guess what it is. Great sharp focus and the pastels color palette you pulled off in here!', '2011-07-27 20:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
