(6486448, 963436, 59796, '<td valign="top">For an image that''s in the top 10, I''m surprised it received only 1 comment! Possibly because the voters found it nice and agreeable, but not outstanding? Atleast, I do.<br/> <br/>I like the subtle color gradient - from orange at the top to the blue at the bottom - the sky reflection. If it were me, I would make the lines go the other diagonal way - possibly a silly personal preference :-) The dark reflection of another building at the bottom left is mildly  distracting since the picture doesn''t have a strong subject other than the pattern itself. <br/> <br/>Congratulations on the top10 finish. And I agree - the building''s indeed a nice subject.</td>', 'For an image that''s in the top 10, I''m surprised it received only 1 comment! Possibly because the voters found it nice and agreeable, but not outstanding? Atleast, I do. I like the subtle color gradient - from orange at the top to the blue at the bottom - the sky reflection. If it were me, I would make the lines go the other diagonal way - possibly a silly personal preference :-) The dark reflection of another building at the bottom left is mildly  distracting since the picture doesn''t have a strong subject other than the pattern itself.  Congratulations on the top10 finish. And I agree - the building''s indeed a nice subject.', '2011-08-01 02:21:09.000000', NULL, 0),
